<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Team · Slow Down 4 Sam</title>
        <meta name="description" content="Slow Down 4 Sam — Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs.">
        <meta property="og:title" content="Team · Slow Down 4 Sam" />
        <meta property="og:description" content="Meet the people behind Slow Down 4 Sam, a Michigan nonprofit honoring Sam Gross through motorcycle safety and youth programs." />
        <%- include('_global_meta'); %>
    </head>
    <body>
        <%- include('_header'); %>
        <main id="main">
            <section class="page-hero">
                <div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Team</div>
                    <h1>Family at the center. Volunteers in the work.</h1>
                    <p>Sam’s family still stewards Slow Down 4 Sam. The board and primary volunteers keep the classes, funds, and kids’ programs moving.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="section-head">
                        <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Board of directors</div>
                        <h2>Who holds the mission</h2></div>
                        <div class="grid grid-3">
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">TG</div><h3>The Gross Family</h3><strong>Founding Directors</strong><p>Sam was our little brother. After we lost him in Petoskey, we built Slow Down 4 Sam so his name would stand for care, not just a crash.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">BC</div><h3>Board Chair</h3><strong>Chair of the Board</strong><p>Sets the agenda, keeps the board honest, and makes sure every program still answers to Sam’s story.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">T</div><h3>Treasurer</h3><strong>Treasurer</strong><p>Watches the books, the restricted funds, and the program dollars so donors can see exactly where money went.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">S</div><h3>Secretary</h3><strong>Secretary</strong><p>Records decisions, files reports, and keeps the archive current.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">SE</div><h3>Safety Education Lead</h3><strong>Program Director, Safety</strong><p>Builds the motorcycle safety classes, vets volunteer instructors, and partners with ranges, dealerships, and schools.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><div class="kicker">Y&C</div><h3>Youth &amp; Community Lead</h3><strong>Program Director, Youth</strong><p>Runs hunting and fishing licenses, Scout camp support, and the Christmas fund.</p></article>
                        </div>
                        <div class="section-head" style="margin-top:80px">
                            <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--green-2)">Primary volunteers</div>
                            <h2>The people who make the week happen</h2>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-2">
                            <article class="card"><h3>Motorcycle safety instructors</h3><p class="meta">Volunteer cohort</p><p>Riders who give evenings and weekends to teach clutch control, road craft, and judgment.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><h3>Gear drive coordinators</h3><p class="meta">Volunteer cohort</p><p>Collect, inspect, clean, and place helmets and jackets with riders who need them.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><h3>Youth outdoor mentors</h3><p class="meta">Volunteer cohort</p><p>Help families apply for licenses and get kids to the water and the woods.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><h3>Scout partnership team</h3><p class="meta">Volunteer cohort</p><p>Work with local troops and crews to cover camp fees and uniforms.</p></article>
                            <article class="card"><h3>Holiday fund volunteers</h3><p class="meta">Volunteer cohort</p><p>Shop, wrap, and deliver Christmas for children in foster care.</p></article>
                        </div>
                        <p style="margin-top:30px">Board seats and volunteer leads are listed by role until individual names are published.</p>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Contact the board</a>
                    </div>
                </section>
        </main>
        <%- include('_footer'); %>
    </body>
</html>
